@page "/terms"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms & Conditions — TippSend";
}

@section Styles {
<style>
body { background: var(--gs-cream); }
.terms-hero {
    background: var(--gs-bog-deep);
    padding: 64px 0 48px;
    text-align: center;
}
.terms-body { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 64px 24px 96px; }
.terms-body h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gs-bog-deep); margin: 2rem 0 .5rem; }
.terms-body p, .terms-body li { font-size: 15px; color: var(--gs-bog); line-height: 1.7; }
.terms-body ul { padding-left: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.terms-body .prohibited-list li { color: var(--gs-claret); font-weight: 500; }
.last-updated { font-size: 12px; color: var(--gs-stone); margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--gs-mist); }
</style>
}

<section class="terms-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow mb-3" style="color:var(--gs-gold-soft)">Legal</div>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,46px);color:white;margin:0;letter-spacing:-0.02em">
        Terms &amp; Conditions
    </h1>
    <p style="color:var(--gs-fog);margin-top:12px;font-size:15px">Last updated: June 2026</p>
</section>

<div class="terms-body" id="main-content">

    <h2>1. About TippSend</h2>
    <p>TippSend is a local delivery service based in Clonmel, Co. Tipperary, Ireland. We collect items from one address and deliver them to another within South Tipperary. By booking a delivery you agree to these terms.</p>

    <h2>2. Prohibited Items</h2>
    <p>You must not send any of the following items using TippSend. Doing so is a breach of these terms and may result in immediate cancellation without refund, and may be reported to An Garda Síochána:</p>
    <ul class="prohibited-list">
        <li>Illegal drugs or controlled substances of any kind</li>
        <li>Weapons, firearms, ammunition or any item intended to cause harm</li>
        <li>Stolen goods or items obtained through fraud</li>
        <li>Prescription medicines for a third party without authorisation</li>
        <li>Cash over €200 or financial instruments</li>
        <li>Hazardous materials, flammable liquids, explosives or chemicals</li>
        <li>Live animals</li>
        <li>Counterfeit or illegally copied goods</li>
        <li>Any item whose possession, sale or transport is prohibited under Irish law</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Customer Declaration</h2>
    <p>By completing a booking, you confirm that:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>The item(s) being sent are legal and permitted under Irish law</li>
        <li>You are authorised to send the item(s)</li>
        <li>The item(s) do not appear on the prohibited list above</li>
        <li>All information provided during booking is accurate and truthful</li>
    </ul>
    <p>TippSend relies on this declaration. If false information is provided, full liability rests with the sender.</p>

    <h2>4. Our Right to Refuse</h2>
    <p>TippSend reserves the right to refuse, cancel or terminate any booking at its discretion, including where we have reasonable suspicion that a prohibited item is involved. In such cases a full refund will be issued if collection has not yet taken place.</p>

    <h2>5. Cancellations & Refunds</h2>
    <p>You may cancel your booking for a full refund up to <strong>2 hours before</strong> your scheduled pickup time by contacting us via WhatsApp or email at <a href="mailto:hello@tippsend.ie">hello@tippsend.ie</a>. Cancellations after this point may not be eligible for a refund if the driver is already en route.</p>

    <h2>6. Delivery Times</h2>
    <p>Preferred times are a guide only. We make every reasonable effort to collect and deliver within the requested window, but cannot guarantee exact times due to traffic, access issues or unforeseen circumstances. TippSend is not liable for losses arising from delayed delivery.</p>

    <h2>7. Items Limit</h2>
    <p>Items must fit in a standard car boot and weigh no more than 25 kg. TippSend is not responsible for damage to items that are improperly packaged or inherently fragile.</p>

    <h2>8. Liability</h2>
    <p>TippSend acts as a carrier only. Our liability for loss or damage to an item is limited to the delivery fee paid. We strongly recommend insuring high-value items separately.</p>

    <h2>9. Operating Hours</h2>
    <p>TippSend currently operates <strong>Saturday and Sunday only, 9am–9pm</strong>. Bookings outside these hours will not be fulfilled.</p>

    <h2>10. Contact</h2>
    <p>For any questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@tippsend.ie">hello@tippsend.ie</a> or via WhatsApp.</p>

    <p class="last-updated">These terms were last updated in June 2026 and apply to all bookings made on or after this date. TippSend is operated as a sole trader based in Clonmel, Co. Tipperary, Ireland.</p>
</div>
